WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:08.250
Hello, and welcome to your next Unreal Engine training video on your introduction to Blueprints.

2
00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:13.250
We'll be giving you a brief overview of what Blueprints are and how you can use them in your projects.

3
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:18.250
And we'll mostly be covering terminology about different Blueprint elements.

4
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:23.250
We'll be covering core concepts that you need to continue your Blueprint usage.

5
00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:28.250
We'll be talking you through the different types of Blueprints you can find and experience through the editor.

6
00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:33.250
And we'll also be giving you an editor overview of where to find the different Blueprint elements.
